1
00:00:01,842 --> 00:00:03,822
As Uke makes a thrust with a knife

2
00:00:04,123 --> 00:00:06,616
step back off center and control his wrist,

3
00:00:06,906 --> 00:00:07,406
as you do so

4
00:00:07,407 --> 00:00:08,605
raise his arm up,

5
00:00:08,606 --> 00:00:11,489
turning your hips controlling his elbow 
with your other hand,

6
00:00:11,790 --> 00:00:14,363
step forward bringing Uke down to the mat.

7
00:00:16,364 --> 00:00:19,559
As you pin, apply pressure to Uke´s elbow,

8
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:24,143
raise Uke´s elbow pushing his wrist underneath,

9
00:00:24,444 --> 00:00:29,412
push down on the elbow making the pin 
and at the same time removing the knife.

